    "updated_at": "2026-09-30T20:27:44Z",
    "body": "1. There's no harm in checking for an overflow, but I don't view this change as being high priority because practically this shouldn't impact testing.\n2. I think that the SHA sum acting on the file is the most reasonable behavior. I view these hashes as being useful for forensic purposes, and the file hash is more useful in this setting.",
