    "created_at": "2026-09-30T23:20:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-30T23:20:36Z",
    "body": "Thanks. I'll keep the existing SHA-256 as the whole-file hash for forensic identity. I'll handle the arithmetic issue separately with a checked subset offset, and record the subset index/requested count/actual count explicitly so the assessed range is unambiguous without changing the meaning of the existing hash field.\n",
